{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/laya-heights-laya-dubai-studio-city","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":593,"crm_id":"397","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Laya Heights","slug":"laya-heights-laya-dubai-studio-city","display_address":"Dubai Studio City","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"LAYA Developers","price":650000,"display_price":"650K","lattitude":25.0419684,"longitude":55.2456171,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":1,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Laya Heights is an elite 9-storey residential complex located in the commercial district of Dubai - Dubai Studio City. The facades of the building are designed in a modern style, the interiors are finished with natural high quality materials. Elegant studios and luxurious <strong>one-bedroom apartments</strong> are available for sale. The large windows and balconies of each residence offer mesmerising views of commercial facilities such as directors' and producers' houses, recording studios and a training centre for actors.</p><p>On-site special amenities include an outdoor cinema, areas for various sports, a swimming pool with sun loungers, a children's playground, a sauna and landscaped recreational areas with barbecue facilities.</p><p>A distinctive feature of the complex is its location. Opposite is the prestigious GEMS Metropole School, and within walking distance residents can find the Dubai Polo &amp; Equestrian Club. Dubai Hills Mall can be reached in 5 minutes, while the Mall of the Emirates, Dubai Mall and IMG World of Adventure theme park will take approximately 10-15 minutes to reach.</p><p>Laya Heights offers its residents a self-sufficient and luxurious lifestyle, as well as ample space to work from home and socialise with the building's residents.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null